{"id":"vod_hh_45509","vodId":"45509","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者","name_cn":"火影忍者","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第220集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/77535d1e9929af6f74ed1bc5f7efc374.jpg"},"summary":"十多年前一只拥有巨大威力的妖兽“九尾妖狐”袭击了木叶忍者村，当时的第四代火影拼尽全力，以自己的生命为代价将“九尾妖狐”封印在了刚出生的鸣人身上。木叶村终于恢复了平静，但村民们却把鸣人当成像“九尾妖狐”那样的怪物看待，所有人都疏远他。鸣人自小就孤苦无依，一晃十多年过去了，少年鸣人考入了木叶村的忍者学校，结识了好朋友佐助和小樱。佐助是宇智波家族的传人之一，当他还是小孩的时候他的哥哥——一个已经拥有高超忍术的忍者将他们家族的人都杀死了，然后投靠了一直想将木叶村毁灭的大蛇丸，佐助自小就发誓要超越哥哥，为家族报仇。鸣人他们在忍者学校得到了教官卡卡西的精心指点，在他的帮助下去迎接成长中的一次又一次挑战！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-29 21:06:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":220,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第001集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4VVBVe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第002集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb22201b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第003集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQjjy0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第004集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKzzDMe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第005集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAWWp3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第006集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerBB14e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第007集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej551Pd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第008集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6GGQVd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第009集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb222M1b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第010集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelXXwMe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第011集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0EEZLa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第012集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4VVZxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第013集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXqqOga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第014集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOLLBrb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第015集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGzzqJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第016集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw2248b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第017集","url":"